<title>INDIA: India ACC, F L Smidth in research tie-up.</title>
<headline>India ACC, F L Smidth in research tie-up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's leading cement maker Associated Cement Companies (ACC) on Friday said it would jointly conduct research with F L Smidth and Co AS of Denmark.</p>
<p>The two would conduct cooperative research in areas such as clinker mineralisation, cement quality, blended cements and materials evaluation, an ACC statement said.</p>
<p>F L Smidth and Co is the largest corporation in the F L Smidth Fuller Engineering Group owned by FLS Industries SA of Denmark, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
